and I want to share my feelings with
them.

274
00:19:28,386 --> 00:19:32,386
 There's still a view I don't know in
front of me.

275
00:19:32,386 --> 00:19:38,736
 Hey, let's go anywhere.

276
00:19:39,236 --> 00:19:41,236
 Goodbye, goodbye.

277
00:19:41,236 --> 00:19:43,236
 Thank you for yesterday.

278
00:19:43,236 --> 00:19:47,236
 The city after the rain is colorful.

279
00:19:47,236 --> 00:19:49,236
 I'll draw a fragment of the future

280
00:19:49,236 --> 00:19:51,236
 on the canvas of my damaged heart.

281
00:19:51,236 --> 00:20:11,236
 It will guide me.

282
00:20:11,578 --> 00:20:16,578
 Now is the night, and the reason for my
tears

283
00:20:16,578 --> 00:20:20,578
 When I'm lost, I remember right away

284
00:20:20,578 --> 00:20:24,578
 Even if it rains, I'll smile

285
00:20:24,578 --> 00:20:28,578
 Look, I'll go anywhere

286
00:20:28,578 --> 00:20:32,578
 Goodbye, goodbye, to me of yesterday

287
00:20:32,578 --> 00:20:36,578
 The city lights after the rain are
sparkling

288
00:20:36,578 --> 00:20:40,578
 My heart is like a sunny day, the sound
of the rain drops

289
00:20:40,578 --> 00:20:44,578
 I play the rainbow piano

290
00:20:44,578 --> 00:20:49,578
 Goodbye, goodbye, to me of yesterday

291
00:20:49,578 --> 00:20:53,578
 The city lights after the rain are
sparkling

292
00:20:53,578 --> 00:20:57,578
 My heart is like a sunny day, the sound
of the rain drops

293
00:20:57,578 --> 00:21:20,578
 I wear a rainbow dress

294
00:21:27,578 --> 00:21:31,101
 Translated by Releska
